Parse the user data to JSON, respond using following JSON Schema: <|json_schema|>

## Examples

EXAMPLE INPUT:
    I've got email Frank - their developer, who's 30. He asked to come back to him frank@hk.ch. Btw, he plays on drums!

    EXAMPLE OUTPUT:
    ```json
    {"firstName":"Frank","age":30,"username":"frank@hk.ch","role":"user","hobbies":["playing drums"]}
    ```

EXAMPLE INPUT:
    We have a meeting with John, our new admin who likes surfing. He is 19 years old - check his profile: @jx90.

    EXAMPLE OUTPUT:
    ```json
    {"firstName":"John","role":"admin","hobbies":["surfing"],"username":"jx90","age":19}
    ```

